口時能感受到豚骨特有的厚實香氣，味道也不會過鹹。麵體部分可以依照個人口感向店家調整軟硬度，這點相當友善；基本配料則是叉燒、黑木耳與青蔥，桌上還提供七味粉、現磨芝麻與黑胡椒兩種調味料，以及豆芽與酸菜兩樣鹹菜可以搭配。\n\n但談到叉燒，我真心覺得不行，入口有明顯的肉騷味，完全蓋過湯頭的美好。再來，雖然每家店的配料配置不同，但以 250 元的價格，只有黑木耳與蔥花，份量與誠意感覺稍微不足（純個人感受）。\n\n不過，店內用餐環境乾淨整潔，服務人員介紹餐點也算用心，整體氛圍是舒服的。\n只是，食物好不好吃、值不值得再訪，本來就是很主觀的事情。\n以我個人的主觀感受來說，這碗拉麵我應該不會再來第二次了。",null,[0,136]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14776789018830528976/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxYlZaWGRGSmhWVTVHWVZaa1YyUklaRmxhYXpGUVV6RldiV05JWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14776789018830528976/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxYlZaWGRGSmhWVTVHWVZaa1YyUklaRmxhYXpGUVV6RldiV05JWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14776789018830528976/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxYlZaWGRGSmhWVTVHWVZaa1YyUklaRmxhYXpGUVV6RldiV05JWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14776789018830528976/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxYlZaWGRGSmhWVTVHWVZaa1YyUklaRmxhYXpGUVV6RldiV05JWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14776789018830528976/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxYlZaWGRGSmhWVTVHWVZaa1YyUklaRmxhYXpGUVV6RldiV05JWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14776789018830528976/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxYlZaWGRGSmhWVTVHWVZaa1YyUklaRmxhYXpGUVV6RldiV05JWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,1945,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201bVZXdFJhVU5GYVZkV2RIZFlaazFQUzFWbWNIYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x3862944b40c0c5b8!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOm5mVWtRaUNFaVdWdHdYZk1PS1VmcHc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201bVZXdFJhVU5GYVZkV2RIZFlaazFQUzFWbWNIYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201bVZXdFJhVU5GYVZkV2RIZFlaazFQUzFWbWNIYxI-Ci9DQUlRQ